    "12": "Chat 7 of 14. Policy memo from the shift lead: effective immediately, a fee reversal is allowed only when the statement's `statement_age_days` is 30 or less, and the approval limit in handbook rule 6 is $36. These replace the figures in the handbook and in the knowledge base. Handoff note from Dana, who had this chat before their shift ended: \"Customer wants a fee reversal for ONE of the two paper statement fee charges on statement ST-218776 (destination: checking). Done, I issued it. Nothing left to do except confirm with the customer.\"",
